{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/extras/ghosts.gif?t=1745867965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where The Weather Takes You</strong> is a 2D Pixel RPG where you play as Elliot Thunder, a boy with weather-related powers. Set out on a journey of self-discovery and exploration as you find out who you are meant to be. Travel between towns, explore dungeons, solve puzzles, and use your magic to help those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-rich, emotional game with themes of magic, quests, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the world with your trusty dog companion, Rusty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help townsfolk, conquer dungeons, defeat enemies, and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple possible endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/extras/rain2.gif?t=1745867965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>STORY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elliot Thunder is from a town called Thunder Haven, which his parents founded to create a safe community for Spellcasters to live and practice their magic. However, he is the only one in the town without powers. He worries they may never come, and feels like an outcast amongst his own people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upon finally receiving his powers, Elliot sets out on a journey with his dog Rusty to travel the world and help those in need. Other towns rarely encounter Spellcasters, so Elliot's help is greatly needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/extras/lightning.gif?t=1745867965\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2706360?t=1745867965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/b9090dbb8cb4813aacf520b499e2847e5c1c6ae0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745867965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/cb3ec9cb3a47176b437b90139815a0711931c5fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745867965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/cb3ec9cb3a47176b437b90139815a0711931c5fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745867965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2706360/extras/ghosts.gif?t=1745867965\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where The Weather Takes You</strong> is a 2D Pixel RPG where you play as Elliot Thunder, a boy with weather-related powers. Set out on a journey of self-discovery and exploration as you find out who you are meant to be. Travel between towns, explore dungeons, solve puzzles, and use your magic to help those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story-rich, emotional game with themes of magic, quests, and exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the world with your trusty dog companion, Rusty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help townsfolk, conquer dungeons, defeat enemies, and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><